<metadata><name>Day 27 - Roberts, Irwin Quarry, Walking Fern</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.709749" lon="-79.962893"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on Tenth Line, 2.2 km southeast of 32 Sideroad (Halton Road 42)</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.703817" lon="-79.964765"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: End of the Walking Fern Side Trail. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.709536" lon="-79.962880"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: You pass the start again. Keep going on the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading west.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.701003" lon="-79.966191"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Roberts Side Trail, heading south-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.692181" lon="-79.966455"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Irwin Quarry Side Trail, heading south-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left; the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.693184" lon="-79.965842"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turn sharp right onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
